      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man malaika ma waweco wakude ebino kendo, man ecewa, calu dhanu ma jucewo ku wang’ nindo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ira kumae, Ineno ang’o? Man awacu kumae, Aneno, man, nen, thethala mi mola ma kwar kwa, ku tabune i wie, ku thalane abiro i wie; man wendthalane abiro kubang’gi nzu, ma gini i wie; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.11.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 11:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man yendulam ario i vute, acel yo ku cing’ ma yor acwic ni tabune, mucelo ke yo ku cing’ ma yor acamne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E aloko lembe man awacu ni malaika ma waweco wakude, awacu kumae, Maeni ang’o, rwoth para? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E malaika ma waweco wakude lund uloko ira lembe man ewacu ira kumae, Ing’eyo ngo nia maeni ang’o? Man awacu kumae, Ungo, rwoth para. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elund eloko lembe ewacu ira, ewacu kumae, Maeni lembe pa Yehova ni Zerubabel, kumae, Ku kero ngo, kadi ku tego de ngo, ento ku Tipona, Yehova mir udul uwacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In i ng’a, E got ma diti? i wang’ Zerubabel ibidoko ni poga: man ebiwodho kidi ma malu woko ku kok ire mi Bero, bero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ke lembe pa Yehova bino i bang’a, m’uwacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cing’ Zerubabel uketho thepiny mi ot maeni; cinge bende bidare; man ibing’eyo nia Yehova mir udul uora i beng’wu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.5.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 5:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.5.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 5:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum ng’a ma cayu ceng’ mi gin ma noki? kum maeni abiro anyong’a binegogi, man gibineno jampor i cing’ Zerubabel; maeni wang’ Yehova, m’uringo kun ku kun kud i ng’om ngung’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
